From 5c1833df2e5170054cbbe68a02000e43d17d7d6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:45:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Camera2 path: manual ISO, shutter and focus, RAW (DNG),
 OIS, burst

Camera1 on this HAL has no keys for the HAL3 manual controls. libcamx gains
a Camera2 still capture through the NDK (cam2.cpp, declarations of the used
NDK part in ndk-camera.h): Camera1 disconnects, libcamx meters and focuses
with a small YUV stream, shoots JPEG (and RAW16) with the manual values and
returns; the app writes the DNG and reconnects Camera1.

The process needs a binder thread pool for the Camera2 callbacks; the pool
is started without changing its size (the compatibility layer may have
started it) and the thread name libbinder sets is put back.

Signed-off-by: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
